    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598080/extras/302784791785937be2450d13d1fc8fce.poster.avif?t=1743734226\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598080/extras/302784791785937be2450d13d1fc8fce.apng?t=1743734226\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=41 /></picture></span><br>Drift Survivor is a small-scale, endlessly challenging arcade-style game with one simple objective: consistently surpass your previous high score and secure your name on the Steam online leaderboard! Along the way, you can earn coins and unlock a variety of new vehicles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598080/extras/6287a5a48a9e0e73ebeb67c590cc0c49.poster.avif?t=1743734226\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598080/extras/6287a5a48a9e0e73ebeb67c590cc0c49.apng?t=1743734226\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=41 /></picture></span><br>\u00b7Drift your car using the throttle and left/right keys! Quickly grab &quot;Time Cores&quot; to extend your gameplay duration.<br>\u00b7Colliding with enemies or walls results in significant time loss, but skillful use of the brake/reverse key can prevent collisions and create impressive evasive maneuvers!<br>\u00b7Eliminating enemies with your vehicle's weapons yields higher scores.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598080/extras/8c8ff4d3dfd784f44d8864ea604efd89.poster.avif?t=1743734226\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598080/extras/8c8ff4d3dfd784f44d8864ea604efd89.apng?t=1743734226\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=41 /></picture></span><br>\u00b7Paying homage to the fundamentals of classic arcade games!<br>\u00b7Easy-to-learn yet challenging drift controls!<br>\u00b7Random appearance of super weapon crates during gameplay, providing powerful firepower support!<br>\u00b7Collect coins to unlock vehicles with different attributes and appearances!<br>\u00b7Leave your mark on the Steam leaderboard!<br><br>Experience the thrill of Drift Survivor today and prove your arcade gaming prowess!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598080/extras/622edc464da71ad58c3a16ebefa3013b.poster.avif?t=1743734226\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598080/extras/622edc464da71ad58c3a16ebefa3013b.gif?t=1743734226\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br>Special statement: Although the word &quot;Survivor&quot; is in the name of the game, this game is not a &quot;Vampire Survivors like&quot; game. This game requires frequent &quot;drifting&quot; operations to move vehicles and avoid enemies. Although there are abundant supply props, it is not a numerical construction game. I apologize if it has misled you!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598080/extras/302784791785937be2450d13d1fc8fce.poster.avif?t=1743734226\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598080/extras/302784791785937be2450d13d1fc8fce.apng?t=1743734226\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=41 /></picture></span><br>Drift Survivor is a small-scale, endlessly challenging arcade-style game with one simple objective: consistently surpass your previous high score and secure your name on the Steam online leaderboard! Along the way, you can earn coins and unlock a variety of new vehicles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598080/extras/6287a5a48a9e0e73ebeb67c590cc0c49.poster.avif?t=1743734226\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598080/extras/6287a5a48a9e0e73ebeb67c590cc0c49.apng?t=1743734226\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=41 /></picture></span><br>\u00b7Drift your car using the throttle and left/right keys! Quickly grab &quot;Time Cores&quot; to extend your gameplay duration.<br>\u00b7Colliding with enemies or walls results in significant time loss, but skillful use of the brake/reverse key can prevent collisions and create impressive evasive maneuvers!<br>\u00b7Eliminating enemies with your vehicle's weapons yields higher scores.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598080/extras/8c8ff4d3dfd784f44d8864ea604efd89.poster.avif?t=1743734226\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598080/extras/8c8ff4d3dfd784f44d8864ea604efd89.apng?t=1743734226\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=41 /></picture></span><br>\u00b7Paying homage to the fundamentals of classic arcade games!<br>\u00b7Easy-to-learn yet challenging drift controls!<br>\u00b7Random appearance of super weapon crates during gameplay, providing powerful firepower support!<br>\u00b7Collect coins to unlock vehicles with different attributes and appearances!<br>\u00b7Leave your mark on the Steam leaderboard!<br><br>Experience the thrill of Drift Survivor today and prove your arcade gaming prowess!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598080/extras/622edc464da71ad58c3a16ebefa3013b.poster.avif?t=1743734226\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598080/extras/622edc464da71ad58c3a16ebefa3013b.gif?t=1743734226\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br>Special statement: Although the word &quot;Survivor&quot; is in the name of the game, this game is not a &quot;Vampire Survivors like&quot; game. This game requires frequent &quot;drifting&quot; operations to move vehicles and avoid enemies. Although there are abundant supply props, it is not a numerical construction game. I apologize if it has misled you!",
    "short_description": "Paying Tribute to Classic Arcade Shooting Games. Drift Survivor is an addictive and fast-paced arcade shooting game that combines &quot;drifting&quot; with a &quot;bullet hell&quot; gameplay style!",
